Three handlers are affected: `PATCH /accounts/:id`, `DELETE /accounts/:id` and `PATCH /orders/:id/cancel`. Each one trusts the id in the URL and ignores `req.user.accountId`, which `sessionUser` already sets. The fix is to put the account into each `WHERE` clause and return 404 when nothing matches.

**Orders** (`routes/orders.js`): add `account_id` to the predicate.

```js
